        {
          "topic": "block angle",
          "conclusion": "Block._calculate_block_angle compares the player's horizontal facing with the horizontal direction from the player to the attacking unit's position; it does not use a projectile's incoming trajectory. The default inner threshold is 0.33π = 59.4° to either side of facing, for a total front cone of 118.8°.",
          "refs": [
