        },
        {
          "topic": "ranged block-cost interpolation",
          "conclusion": "In linesman_rangedblock, block_cost_ranged.inner lerp_basic=0.75 and lerp_perfect=0.25 are interpolation endpoints, not ordinary/perfect block costs. The two supported force-sword variants use this template. Their defence stat maps to stamina_trait_templates.thunderhammer_p1_m1_defence_stat, which adjusts block_cost_default inner/outer, push_cost, and sprint cost but has no block_cost_ranged target. With no ranged-target lerp value, the resolver uses DEFAULT_FALLBACK_LERP_VALUE=0.5, producing resolved ranged inner cost lerp(0.75,0.25,0.5)=0.5. With all other cost and payment modifiers equal to 1, Deflector I–IV therefore yield 0.3875, 0.375, 0.3625, and 0.35 stamina points before a separate stamina_cost_multiplier.",
